				{
					"id": "o3",
					"text": "Only via `process.on(\"uncaughtException\")`"
				},
				{
					"id": "o4",
					"text": "Express restarts the request"
				}
			],
			"question": "In Express 5, how is an error from an async handler forwarded to the error middleware?"
		},
		{
			"id": "q3",
			"marks": 5,
